      "content": "Thanks for the summary. Just to be super clear—when you say \"insufficient access controls\" and \"outdated protocols,\" are we talking about things we can fix with some configuration updates and patches, or are we looking at something more fundamental, like the entire authentication system being fundamentally broken and needing a complete overhaul? I need to know if I'm looking at a million-dollar infrastructure project or just some standard maintenance.",
